// --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//        TEST HTTP REQUESTS
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Home
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get game data
GET http://localhost:3000/api/gamedata

### Post game data (expects 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/gamedata
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": 512.4,
  "mode": "nameflag",
  "region": "europe",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "time": 95,
  "username": "tester"
}

### Post invalid game data (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/gamedata
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": "lots",
  "mode": "nameflag",
  "region": "europe",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "time": 95,
  "username": ""
}

### Get europe data
GET http://localhost:3000/api/europe

### Get africa data
GET http://localhost:3000/api/africa

### Get asia data
GET http://localhost:3000/api/asia
